{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">內地股市回調。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">四大指數中，深圳創業板指數跌幅較大，跌逾百分之1。滬深京三市成交不足2.6萬億元人民幣。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">晶片股下跌，醫藥和白酒板塊逆市上升。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-15T09:38:58.790946+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":71,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}